OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBreaks in    
OL,6,Fthe cloud will allow temperatures to   
OL,7,Ffall and frost to form before turning  
OL,8,Fcloudy with patchy rain by the         
OL,9,Fmorning, which may turn wintry over    
OL,10,Fhigh ground.                           
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy with a band of rain    
OL,13,Fmoving eastwards across the region,    
OL,14,Fthis could fall as freezing rain       
OL,15,Fbefore turning to snow over high       
OL,16,Fground. Winds will become increasingly 
OL,17,Fbreezy.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
